# "You may have this creature enter as a copy": the choice is made by the player who will control it as it enters (CR 614.12,
# 707.2), not by its owner. Bot2 discards Clone to hand size; Bot1 reanimates it from Bot2's graveyard under Bot1's control.
# Bot1 is asked and accepts, and with Bot1's Ornithopter the only creature, it enters as an Ornithopter without asking which.
# Bot1 loses 4 life, Clone's mana value.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Reanimate
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Clone
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot2.Graveyard = Clone
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Reanimate.Cast(Bot2.Graveyard.Clone)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Accept

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Life = 16
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Ornithopter; Ornithopter
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
